{%- comment -%}
  Refreshed product photography for the Option A / B previews (theme assets plo-ph-<key>-1..8.jpg,
  from the Sept/Oct 2026 shoot). Outputs the photo key for a product handle, or nothing.
  Usage: {%- capture pkey -%}{%- render 'plo-photo-key', handle: product.handle -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  Photo 1 is the clean pack shot used on cards and in the cart; 2–8 fill the product gallery.
  Only the preview templates read this, so live product media is untouched.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case handle -%}
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-hazelnut-bar-6-x-80g' -%}hazel
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-sea-salt-bar-6-x-80g' -%}seasalt
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-bar-6-x-80g' -%}dark
  {%- when 'plaay-70-dark-chocolate-caramel-crunch-mousse-bar-6-x-80g' -%}caramel
  {%- when 'plaay-milk-chocolate-cheesecake-bar-6-x-80g' -%}cheese
  {%- when 'plaay-milk-chocolate-toffee-almond-bar-6-x-80g' -%}toffee
  {%- when 'pistachio-chocolate-bar-x-12' -%}pistbar
  {%- when 'triple-chocolate-truffle' -%}triple
  {%- when 'peanut-butter-truffle' -%}pb
{%- endcase -%}
